```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuario
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as Redis/Celery
    participant W as Worker
    participant AI as AI Engine
    participant FS as Storage

    U->>FE: Selecciona imagen
    FE->>API: POST /pages
    API->>API: Validar MIME, tamaño y dimensiones
    API->>FS: Guardar original
    API->>DB: Crear Page(status=ANALYSIS_PENDING)
    API->>Q: Encolar analyze_page(page_id)
    API-->>FE: 202 Accepted + page_id
    Q->>W: Ejecutar análisis
    W->>FS: Leer original
    W->>AI: Detectar paneles/personajes
    AI-->>W: Detecciones y máscaras
    W->>FS: Guardar artefactos
    W->>DB: Guardar paneles, apariciones y propuestas
    W->>DB: Page(status=REVIEW_REQUIRED)
    FE-->>U: Mostrar personajes detectados
```

**Source:** arc42.md §6.2 Secuencia: análisis de página

**Purpose:** Shows the end-to-end analysis flow: the user selects an image, the frontend posts it to the API, the API validates and stores the original, creates a Page record, enqueues the analysis task, and returns 202 Accepted with page_id. The worker reads the image, invokes the AI engine for panel/character detection and masks, persists artifacts and proposals, and marks the page as ready for review.
